requestCost (default 20000): the estimated cost, in bytes, of each additional CSS request. Larger values bias toward fewer, larger shared chunks, and fewer requests overall.weightDistribution (default 0.1): controls how a shared chunk's cost is distributed across the routes that load it, weighted by how much CSS each route imports. 0 weights every route equally; higher values give more weight to routes that import less CSS, so the algorithm prioritizes routes with less CSS, assuming extra CSS is less noticeable on large routes.
